# OS / editor junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Secrets and signing material - pre-empt the leak, never catch it afterwards.
*.pfx
*.snk
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.pem
.env
*token*
*secret*

# local zip build staging (the published universal-agent-kit.zip is tracked on purpose)
_uak_build/
# The distributable is tracked deliberately: index.html links it for download and Pages serves this
# tree as-is, so a clone and the published site must carry the exact bytes users get.
!universal-agent-kit.zip

# Scratch, logs and backups live under one tree and never at the repo root.
temp/
